# `discovery: ref` runs the command from `repo/nested`, below the repository root. `check`
# lists the bodies under `items/` out of the revision, and `ls-tree` scopes a listing to the
# working directory's path inside it — so from down here every body read as missing and a
# consistent tracker failed its own check (#pa9jtd5).
new "First" --id aaaaaaa --body "One body."
new "Second" --id bbbbbbb --body "Another body."
